  "published": "2026-06-18T14:32:34.367Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Major Update: Server-side Architectural Refactoring.\n      - Protocol Consolidation: Removed 'HttpServerProtocol' layer entirely. Static content caching and routing logic are now integrated directly into 'HttpServer' and 'HttpsServer' for improved performance and reduced indirection.\n      - Resource Management: Centralized resource lifecycle management. Disposed 'FileCache' directly within the server's 'Dispose' flow, ensuring deterministic resource cleanup and preventing potential memory leaks.\n      - API Streamlining: Simplified static content management (Add/Remove/Clear) by exposing direct access to 'FileCache' and 'Mapping', reducing call stack depth.\n      - Performance Gains: Throughput further improved by eliminating layer-to-layer method forwarding, reducing CPU branch mispredictions, and tightening memory access patterns for the hot-path request routing.",
